  "details": "I upload multiple versions of the same avatar in order to have different outfit options while keeping a medium performance rank. If I want to use the same accessory with multiple versions of said avatar, I need to manually copy these settings. In addition, due to the simplified nature of the UI, there is no way to manually copy these settings exactly.\n\nI would love the ability to copy these accessory settings, or \"looks\" between avatars, or at least the ability to access the exact transform values so they can be copy and pasted.\n\nThanks :)",
